tts-local
=========

이 저장소의 원저작물(코드·UI·프롬프트·문서·도구 설계)은 DongJu Kim(gggg8657)이 작성했다.
제3자 구성요소는 각자의 라이선스를 따르며 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 에 적었다.
제3자 구성요소의 권리는 이 저장소의 라이선스로 바뀌지 않는다.
연구·내부 시험용 프로토타입이며 배포·상업 서비스용이 아니다.

This package wraps (does not modify) the following open-source software:

  MeloTTS — https://github.com/myshell-ai/MeloTTS   (MIT, MyShell.ai)
    Korean checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/myshell-ai/MeloTTS-Korean (MIT)
    Korean BERT used by the Korean frontend: https://huggingface.co/kykim/bert-kor-base
      (no license on the model card; upstream LMkor README says Apache-2.0 but also asks commercial users for an MOU —
       check before commercial use: https://github.com/gggg8657/tts-local/issues/1)
  python-mecab-ko + mecab-ko-dic — Korean morphological analyzer used by g2pkk (Apache-2.0 / BSD-style)
  g2pkk — Korean grapheme-to-phoneme (Apache-2.0)
  MeloTTS also installs other-language dependencies, some GPL (pykakasi GPL-3.0+, Unidecode GPL-2.0+, Distance GPL) and,
  with GPU torch, NVIDIA proprietary CUDA wheels — none are bundled in this repository; see
  https://github.com/gggg8657/tts-local/issues/2 before redistributing a pack.sh bundle.
  pykakasi is never loaded: the authored stub pykakasi.py shadows it (Korean only).
  No voice cloning. F5-TTS is not used (its released weights are CC-BY-NC-4.0).

Files authored for this package (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0): app.py, ui.html, selftest.py, setup.sh, pack.sh, MeCab.py, pykakasi.py, README.md

